      en: ["1910: Year the six towns federated to form one single borough.", "1925: Year Stoke-on-Trent was granted official city status.", "47: Number of historic bottle kilns still standing in the city today.", "1730: Birth year of the world-famous potter Josiah Wedgwood.", "3,500: Pieces in the Staffordshire Hoard, partly displayed in the city.", "1888: Year the Football League was founded at a meeting here."],
