      es: ["Centro de la industria siderúrgica", "Minster Church of All Saints", "Situada en el río Don", "Magna Science Adventure Centre"],
      pt: ["Centro da indústria siderúrgica", "Minster Church of All Saints", "Localizada no rio Don", "Magna Science Adventure Centre"],
